  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Presente continuo** = acciones que pasan **ahora**: *be* + verbo + **-ing**.",
      "",
      "| + | I'm cooking · she's cooking · they're cooking |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| − | I'm not cooking · he isn't cooking · we aren't cooking |",
      "| ? | Are you cooking? · Is she cooking? |",
      "",
      "**Respuestas cortas:** *Yes, I am. / No, I'm not.*",
      "",
      "**Ortografía de -ing:**",
      "- normal: *work → working*",
      "- termina en -e (se pierde): *make → making*",
      "- vocal corta + consonante (se duplica): *swim → swimming, run → running*",
      "",
      "**Hábito vs ahora:** *I play football on Saturdays* (siempre) · *I'm playing football now* (ahora)."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "I cooking.",
        "right": "I'm cooking.",
        "note": "Falta el verbo to be."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "She is work.",
        "right": "She is working.",
        "note": "Después de be el verbo lleva -ing."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
